# Phase 2: Move Alloy to an Internal Port

## Back up the configuration

```bash
cd /opt/observability

cp -a docker-compose.yml docker-compose.yml.backup.$(date +%F-%H%M)

cp -a alloy/config.alloy alloy/config.alloy.backup.$(date +%F-%H%M)
```

## Edit Docker Compose

```bash
vi /opt/observability/docker-compose.yml
```

Replace:

```yaml
ports:
  - "${MONITOR_IP}:12345:12345"
  - "${MONITOR_IP}:1514:1514/tcp"
  - "${MONITOR_IP}:1514:1514/udp"
```

with:

```yaml
ports:
  - "${MONITOR_IP}:12345:12345"
  - "127.0.0.1:2514:1514/tcp"
```

Meaning:

```text
Host 127.0.0.1:2514 → Alloy container port 1514
```

VM2 will now connect to Syslog-NG on port 1514, and Syslog-NG will relay to Alloy through localhost port 2514.

