# Phase 5: Prepare Local Disk Storage

## Create the directory

```bash
mkdir -p /var/log/remote
chown root:root /var/log/remote
chmod 0750 /var/log/remote
```

## Configure SELinux file context

```bash
semanage fcontext -a -t var_log_t "/var/log/remote(/.*)?" 2>/dev/null || semanage fcontext -m -t var_log_t "/var/log/remote(/.*)?"

restorecon -Rv /var/log/remote

ls -ldZ /var/log/remote
```

## Label TCP ports 1514 and 2514

```bash
semanage port -a -t syslogd_port_t -p tcp 1514 2>/dev/null || semanage port -m -t syslogd_port_t -p tcp 1514
```

```bash
semanage port -a -t syslogd_port_t -p tcp 2514 2>/dev/null || semanage port -m -t syslogd_port_t -p tcp 2514
```

Confirm:

```bash
semanage port -l | grep syslogd_port_t
```

